   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div>Bona nit, </div><div><br></div><div>Corregeixo el darrer correu, el dimarts 10 si que existia era el dimecres 10 el que no. Bueno, suposo que són les preses i que ja toca descansar. Quin lio estic fent... perdoneu.</div>\r\n<div><br></div>Me&#39;n vaig a dormir..."
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div><br clear=\"all\">Lluís Ramon<br>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2012/7/4 Lluís Ramon <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lluisra...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\nBona nit a tots, <div><br></div><div>M&#39;acaben d&#39;avisar que m&#39;he equivocat amb la data de la reunió. </div><div><br></div><div>Si no hi ha cap inconvenient per part de la UB, la reunió serà el <b>dimecres dia 11 de juliol de 2012</b> ( per lo vist el dimarts 10 de juliol de 2012 no existeix hehe).</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Ja ho he corregit al bloc però per si a cas us informo aquí també.</div><div><br></div><div>Aprofito per demanar-vos que si podeu fer difusió entre la gent que conegueu i que pugui estar interessada us agrairia que els informéssiu.</div>\r\n\r\n<div><br></div><div>Gràcies i perdoneu les molèsties,</div><div><br><div>Lluís Ramon<div><div><br>\r\n<br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\">2012/7/4 Lluís Ramon <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lluisra...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span><br><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n<table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"max-width:1024px;text-align:left;color:rgb(102,102,102);min-width:320px;width:520px;font-size:14px;margin:0px auto;font-family:arial,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" height=\"8\" style=\"background-image:url(&#39;https://ci5.googleusercontent.com/proxy/dWVefzFY_peQVUz5tMk3mCVY1yc5BLioIrWlW8ANFkhn405QMsZQeB3klBZD9u0Xcg8HMQyO3KlulwmtP7oK9OScFNkBN6hnjsfQW_ZON4-NLw=s0-d-e1-ft#https://mail.google.com/mail/ca/?ui=2\\000026view=bsp\\000026ver=ohhl4rw8mbn4&#39;);background-color:rgb(67,164,208);min-height:8px;width:520px;background-repeat:repeat no-repeat\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"></td></tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"color:rgb(0,136,204);margin:0px;font-size:1.6em;background-color:rgb(239,239,239);padding:0px;border-bottom-width:1px;border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-color:rgb(221,221,221);width:520px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><h2 style=\"padding:0px;margin:5px 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:1;font-weight:normal;color:rgb(70,70,70);font-family:&#39;Helvetica Neue&#39;,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nrugbcn (<a href style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">rug...@gmail.com</a>) shared a post from rugbcn</h2></td><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;text-align:right\"><img border=\"0\" alt=\"\" style=\"margin:5px 20px 5px 0px;vertical-align:middle\"></td>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</tr></tbody></table><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"20\" bgcolor=\"#ffffff\" style=\"width:520px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:480px\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><table border=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"width:480px\"><tbody><tr><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif;width:60px!important;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top\">\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</td><td style=\"margin:0px;font-family:arial,sans-serif\"><h2 style=\"margin:0px;color:rgb(85,85,85);font-size:20px\"><a href=\"http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/04/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-r-segona-sessio/\" style=\"color:rgb(37,133,178);text-decoration:none!important\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://rugbcn.wordpress.com/2012/07/04/curs-gratuit-diniciacio-a-